# Literals: text into quotes and back
#
# A string travels in quotes with the awkward characters spelled out, the
# way JSON does it. unwrap turns the spelled form back into text, wrap
# spells text out, and a round trip has to give back exactly what went in.

unwrap "lib/a.sh"
unwrap "a \"b\"\nc"
unwrap "\/\b\f"
unwrap "café 😀"
unwrap bats
unwrap "a\qb"
wrap plain
wrap
wrap a "quote" and a \ backslash
wrap café 😀
wrap a "quote", a \\ backslash,\na line\tand a tab, \r\b\f and \0001
roundtrip café 😀 with "quotes" and \\ and\nlines
